"Your DHL Express account number. The MyDHL API needs it to quote your rates."
msgstr ""
"Le numéro de votre compte DHL Express. MyDHL API en a besoin pour calculer "
"vos tarifs."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:622
#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:666
msgid "Origin city"
msgstr "Ville d'origine"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:622
msgid "The city parcels ship from. DHL needs it with the postal code."
msgstr "La ville d'où partent les colis. DHL en a besoin avec le code postal."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:624
#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:647
#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:669
msgid "Origin country"
msgstr "Pays d'origine"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:625
#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:648
#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:662
msgid "The unit your product weights are entered in."
msgstr "L'unité dans laquelle les poids de vos produits sont saisis."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:626
msgid "Sends requests to DHL’s test server."
msgstr "Envoie les requêtes au serveur de test de DHL."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:635
msgid "Your DHL Express account number."
msgstr "Le numéro de votre compte DHL Express."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:640
msgid "FedEx"
msgstr "FedEx"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:642
msgid "Enable FedEx"
msgstr "Activer FedEx"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:642
msgid ""
"Quotes FedEx services with the REST API key and secret from your FedEx "
"developer project."
msgstr ""
"Calcule les tarifs FedEx à l'aide de la clé et du secret d'API REST de votre "
"projet développeur FedEx."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:644
msgid "API secret key"
msgstr "Clé secrète API"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:649
#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:670
#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:684
msgid "Rate multiplier"
msgstr "Multiplicateur de tarif"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:649
msgid ""
"Converts FedEx’s quote currency to yours, or pads every rate. 1.000 leaves "
"quotes as they are."
msgstr ""
"Convertit la devise des tarifs FedEx dans la vôtre, ou majore chaque tarif. "
"1,000 laisse les tarifs inchangés."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:650
msgid "Check for business addresses"
msgstr "Vérifier les adresses professionnelles"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:650
msgid ""
"Asks FedEx whether the address is residential or business before quoting, so "
"business rates apply where they should. Needs Address Validation Service "
"permission on your FedEx project."
msgstr ""
"Demande à FedEx si l'adresse est résidentielle ou professionnelle avant de "
"calculer le tarif, afin que les tarifs professionnels s'appliquent là où ils "
"doivent. Nécessite l'autorisation Address Validation Service sur votre "
"projet FedEx."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:652
msgid "Use FedEx account discounts"
msgstr "Utiliser les remises du compte FedEx"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:652
msgid "Quotes your negotiated FedEx rates instead of list rates."
msgstr "Utilise vos tarifs FedEx négociés au lieu des tarifs publics."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:653
msgid "Sends requests to FedEx’s sandbox."
msgstr "Envoie les requêtes à l'environnement de test (sandbox) de FedEx."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:657
msgid "UPS"
msgstr "UPS"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:659
msgid "Enable UPS"
msgstr "Activer UPS"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:659
msgid ""
"Quotes UPS services through your linked UPS account. Link the account below, "
"then fill in the shipper details."
msgstr ""
"Calcule les tarifs UPS via votre compte UPS lié. Liez le compte ci-dessous, "
"puis renseignez les informations de l'expéditeur."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:661
msgid "Shipper number"
msgstr "Numéro d'expéditeur"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:661
msgid "The six-character account number from your UPS profile."
msgstr "Le numéro de compte à six caractères de votre profil UPS."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:663
msgid "Origin address line 1"
msgstr "Adresse d'origine, ligne 1"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:664
msgid "Origin address line 2"
msgstr "Adresse d'origine, ligne 2"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:665
msgid "Origin address line 3"
msgstr "Adresse d'origine, ligne 3"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:667
msgid "Origin state or province code"
msgstr "Code d'état ou de province d'origine"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:667
msgid "Two-character code, for example NY or ON."
msgstr "Code à deux caractères, par exemple NY ou ON."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:670
msgid ""
"Converts UPS’s quote currency to yours, or pads every rate. 1.000 leaves "
"quotes as they are."
msgstr ""
"Convertit la devise des tarifs UPS dans la vôtre, ou majore chaque tarif. "
"1,000 laisse les tarifs inchangés."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:671
msgid "Use negotiated rates"
msgstr "Utiliser les tarifs négociés"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:671
msgid "Quotes your account’s negotiated rates when UPS returns them."
msgstr "Utilise les tarifs négociés de votre compte lorsque UPS les renvoie."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:675
msgid "USPS"
msgstr "USPS"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:677
msgid "Enable USPS"
msgstr "Activer USPS"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:677
msgid ""
"Quotes USPS services through the USPS API. Uses the WP EasyCart USPS app "
"unless you enter your own credentials."
msgstr ""
"Calcule les tarifs USPS via l'API USPS. Utilise l'application USPS de WP "
"EasyCart sauf si vous saisissez vos propres identifiants."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:678
msgid "Use my own USPS app"
msgstr "Utiliser ma propre application USPS"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:678
msgid ""
"Connect with a client ID and secret from your own USPS developer app instead "
"of the WP EasyCart app."
msgstr ""
"Se connecte avec un ID client et un secret provenant de votre propre "
"application développeur USPS au lieu de l'application WP EasyCart."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:679
msgid "Client ID"
msgstr "ID client"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:679
msgid "From your USPS developer app."
msgstr "Depuis votre application développeur USPS."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:680
msgid "Client secret"
msgstr "Secret client"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:681
msgid "Revert to USPS Web Tools"
msgstr "Revenir à USPS Web Tools"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:681
msgid ""
"Only if you must: Web Tools stopped working in January 2026. Uses the Web "
"Tools username below."
msgstr ""
"Seulement en cas de nécessité absolue : Web Tools a cessé de fonctionner en "
"janvier 2026. Utilise le nom d'utilisateur Web Tools ci-dessous."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:682
msgid "Web Tools username"
msgstr "Nom d'utilisateur Web Tools"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:682
msgid "The legacy USPS Web Tools user ID, usually in the form 123ABCD1234."
msgstr ""
"L'ancien identifiant utilisateur USPS Web Tools, généralement sous la forme "
"123ABCD1234."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:683
msgid "Origin ZIP code"
msgstr "Code postal d'origine"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:684
msgid ""
"Converts USPS’s quote currency to yours, or pads every rate. 1.000 leaves "
"quotes as they are."
msgstr ""
"Convertit la devise des tarifs USPS dans la vôtre, ou majore chaque tarif. "
"1,000 laisse les tarifs inchangés."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:685
msgid "Quote my account’s rates"
msgstr "Utiliser les tarifs de mon compte"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:685
msgid ""
"Uses your USPS payment account for contract or commercial pricing instead of "
"retail."
msgstr ""
"Utilise votre compte de paiement USPS pour une tarification sous contrat ou "
"commerciale au lieu du tarif public."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:686
msgid "Retail"
msgstr "Tarif public"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:686
msgid "Contract"
msgstr "Contrat"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:686
msgid "Commercial"
msgstr "Commercial"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:686
msgid "Price type"
msgstr "Type de tarif"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:687
msgid "Enterprise Payment System ( EPS )"
msgstr "Enterprise Payment System ( EPS )"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:687
msgid "Permit"
msgstr "Permis"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:687
msgid "PC Postage meter"
msgstr "Machine à affranchir PC Postage"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:687
msgid "Mailer ID ( MID )"
msgstr "Mailer ID ( MID )"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:687
msgid "Payment account type"
msgstr "Type de compte de paiement"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:688
msgid ""
"The EPS account, permit number, meter number or MID that matches the type "
"above."
msgstr ""
"Le compte EPS, le numéro de permis, le numéro de machine à affranchir ou le "
"MID correspondant au type ci-dessus."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:689
msgid "CRID"
msgstr "CRID"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:689
msgid "Customer Registration ID of the business the account belongs to."
msgstr ""
"Identifiant d'enregistrement client (CRID) de l'entreprise à laquelle "
"appartient le compte."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:711
msgid "The box editor is not available on this install."
msgstr "L'éditeur de cartons n'est pas disponible sur cette installation."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:765
msgid "Royal Mail 2nd Class"
msgstr "Royal Mail 2nd Class"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:766
msgid "Royal Mail 1st Class"
msgstr "Royal Mail 1st Class"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:767
msgid "Royal Mail 2nd Class Signed For"
msgstr "Royal Mail 2nd Class Signed For"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:768
msgid "Royal Mail 1st Class Signed For"
msgstr "Royal Mail 1st Class Signed For"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:769
msgid "Royal Mail Tracked 48"
msgstr "Royal Mail Tracked 48"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:770
msgid "Royal Mail Tracked 24"
msgstr "Royal Mail Tracked 24"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:771
msgid "Royal Mail Special Delivery Guaranteed by 1pm"
msgstr "Royal Mail Special Delivery Guaranteed by 1pm"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:772
msgid "Royal Mail International Standard"
msgstr "Royal Mail International Standard"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:773
msgid "Royal Mail International Tracked"
msgstr "Royal Mail International Tracked"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:774
msgid "Royal Mail International Economy"
msgstr "Royal Mail International Economy"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:790
msgid "Services"
msgstr "Services"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:790
msgid ""
"Pick the services shoppers can choose, rename them, and charge Royal Mail’s "
"price, a percentage more or less, or a fixed price."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez les services que les clients peuvent sélectionner, renommez-les "
"et facturez le tarif de Royal Mail, un pourcentage en plus ou en moins, ou "
"un tarif fixe."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:793
msgid "UK"
msgstr "Royaume-Uni"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:793
msgid "International"
msgstr "International"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:808
msgid "Prices follow Royal Mail’s price changes"
msgstr "Les tarifs suivent les changements de prix de Royal Mail"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:808
msgid ""
"Royal Mail changes its prices in April and October. The new prices reach "
"your store before their date and take over on the day, without an update."
msgstr ""
"Royal Mail modifie ses tarifs en avril et en octobre. Les nouveaux tarifs "
"arrivent dans votre boutique avant leur date d'entrée en vigueur et prennent "
"le relais ce jour-là, sans mise à jour."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:818
msgid "How shipping is charged, what shoppers can choose, and where you ship."
msgstr ""
"Comment l'expédition est facturée, ce que les acheteurs peuvent choisir et "
"où vous expédiez."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:830
msgid "Whether you charge shipping and how rates are worked out"
msgstr "Si vous facturez la livraison et comment les tarifs sont calculés"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:834
msgid "Charge shipping at checkout"
msgstr "Facturer la livraison au moment du paiement"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:835
msgid ""
"Off means no shipping address or rate is collected and every order is "
"treated as not shipped. The rest of this page only applies when it is on."
msgstr ""
"Désactivé signifie qu'aucune adresse ni tarif de livraison n'est collecté et "
"que chaque commande est traitée comme non expédiée. Le reste de cette page "
"ne s'applique que lorsque c'est activé."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:842
msgid "How rates are calculated"
msgstr "Comment les tarifs sont calculés"

#. translators: %s: plan name, Pro or Premium ( Pro/Premium when no license is known ).
#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:844
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pick the system, then build its rate table on the Shipping rates page. Live "
"carrier rates and Fraktjakt are included with %s."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez le système, puis construisez son tableau de tarifs sur la page "
"Tarifs d'expédition. Les tarifs de transporteur en direct et Fraktjakt sont "
"inclus avec %s."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:854
msgid "Handling fee"
msgstr "Frais de traitement"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:855
msgid ""
"Added on top of every shipping rate as a flat handling charge. Leave at 0 "
"for none."
msgstr ""
"Ajoutés à chaque tarif de livraison sous forme de frais de traitement fixes. "
"Laissez à 0 pour aucun."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:867
msgid "Expedited shipping surcharge"
msgstr "Supplément pour livraison accélérée"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:868
msgid ""
"Offers an expedited choice at the standard rate plus this amount. Price, "
"weight, quantity and percentage systems only; 0 hides the choice."
msgstr ""
"Propose une option accélérée au tarif standard majoré de ce montant. "
"Uniquement pour les systèmes par prix, poids, quantité et pourcentage ; 0 "
"masque l'option."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:881
msgid "Dimension units"
msgstr "Unités de dimension"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:882
msgid ""
"Used when product dimensions drive option pricing or are sent to a live "
"carrier."
msgstr ""
"Utilisées lorsque les dimensions du produit déterminent le prix d'une option "
"ou sont envoyées à un transporteur en direct."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:885
msgid "Standard ( inches )"
msgstr "Standard ( pouces )"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:886
msgid "Metric ( centimetres )"
msgstr "Métrique ( centimètres )"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:898
msgid "Options at checkout"
msgstr "Options au moment du paiement"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:899
msgid "What shoppers see and can choose when shipping is charged"
msgstr ""
"Ce que les acheteurs voient et peuvent choisir lorsque la livraison est "
"facturée"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:903
msgid "Hide rates until an address is entered"
msgstr "Masquer les tarifs tant qu'une adresse n'est pas saisie"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:904
msgid ""
"The cart page shows no shipping estimate; rates appear once the shopper "
"gives their address at checkout."
msgstr ""
"La page panier n'affiche aucune estimation de livraison ; les tarifs "
"apparaissent une fois que l'acheteur indique son adresse au moment du "
"paiement."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:912
msgid "Offer free local pickup"
msgstr "Proposer le retrait local gratuit"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:913
msgid "Adds a no-cost local pickup choice next to your shipping rates."
msgstr ""
"Ajoute une option de retrait local gratuite à côté de vos tarifs de "
"livraison."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:921
msgid "Ship to the billing address only"
msgstr "Livrer uniquement à l'adresse de facturation"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:922
msgid ""
"Removes the separate shipping address form; shoppers are told orders go to "
"their billing address."
msgstr ""
"Supprime le formulaire d'adresse de livraison distinct ; les acheteurs sont "
"informés que les commandes sont envoyées à leur adresse de facturation."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:930
msgid "Charge shipping on subscriptions"
msgstr "Facturer la livraison sur les abonnements"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:931
msgid ""
"Collects a shipping address and adds a rate when a subscription product is "
"marked shippable."
msgstr ""
"Collecte une adresse de livraison et ajoute un tarif lorsqu'un produit "
"d'abonnement est marqué comme livrable."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:939
msgid "Static methods charge per item"
msgstr "Les méthodes fixes facturent par article"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:940
msgid ""
"A static method’s rate is multiplied by the number of items instead of "
"charged once per order."
msgstr ""
"Le tarif d'une méthode fixe est multiplié par le nombre d'articles au lieu "
"d'être facturé une seule fois par commande."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:950
msgid "Free shipping also covers partner shipping"
msgstr "La livraison gratuite couvre aussi la livraison du partenaire"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:951
msgid ""
"When your free shipping applies ( a free-shipping threshold, promotion or "
"coupon ), items a fulfillment partner ships are free to the shopper too and "
"you pay the partner’s shipping. Off, shoppers still pay the partner’s "
"shipping."
msgstr ""
"Lorsque votre livraison gratuite s'applique ( un seuil de livraison "
"gratuite, une promotion ou un coupon ), les articles expédiés par un "
"partenaire de traitement sont aussi gratuits pour le client, et vous payez "
"la livraison du partenaire. Désactivé, les clients paient quand même la "
"livraison du partenaire."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:963
msgid "Boxes and packing"
msgstr "Cartons et emballage"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:964
msgid ""
"The boxes you ship in. Orders are split into packages from them, and a label "
"is bought for each package."
msgstr ""
"Les cartons dans lesquels vous expédiez. Les commandes sont réparties en "
"colis à partir de ceux-ci, et une étiquette est achetée pour chaque colis."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:969
msgid "Pack new orders into boxes"
msgstr "Emballer les nouvelles commandes dans des cartons"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:970
msgid ""
"Each new order is split into packages when it is placed; older orders are "
"packed the first time you open them."
msgstr ""
"Chaque nouvelle commande est répartie en colis lors de sa passation ; les "
"commandes plus anciennes sont emballées la première fois que vous les ouvrez."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:982
msgid "What happens when tracking says an order arrived"
msgstr "Ce qui se passe lorsque le suivi indique qu'une commande est arrivée"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:986
msgid "Mark orders delivered from tracking"
msgstr "Marquer les commandes comme livrées d'après le suivi"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:987
msgid ""
"When a label service reports that every package on a paid order arrived, the "
"order moves to the status below."
msgstr ""
"Lorsqu'un service d'étiquettes indique que tous les colis d'une commande "
"payée sont arrivés, la commande passe à l'état ci-dessous."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:994
msgid "Delivered status"
msgstr "État des commandes livrées"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:995
msgid ""
"The status a delivered order moves to. Rename it or change its colour under "
"Order statuses."
msgstr ""
"L'état vers lequel passe une commande livrée. Renommez-le ou changez sa "
"couleur sous États des commandes."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1008
msgid "How rates fetched from a carrier are quoted and shown"
msgstr "Comment les tarifs obtenus d'un transporteur sont calculés et affichés"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1012
msgid "Show estimated delivery days"
msgstr "Afficher les délais de livraison estimés"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1013
msgid ""
"Adds the carrier’s transit estimate after each live rate, where the carrier "
"provides one."
msgstr ""
"Ajoute l'estimation de délai du transporteur après chaque tarif en direct, "
"lorsque le transporteur en fournit une."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1022
msgid "Quote each item as its own parcel"
msgstr "Calculer le tarif de chaque article comme un colis distinct"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1023
msgid ""
"Live rates are requested per item and added up, instead of one combined "
"package."
msgstr ""
"Les tarifs en direct sont demandés par article puis additionnés, au lieu "
"d'un seul colis combiné."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1032
msgid "Always show overridden rates"
msgstr "Toujours afficher les tarifs remplacés"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1033
msgid ""
"A live rate you have replaced with a fixed amount is shown even when the "
"carrier returns no rate for the address. Off hides it in that case."
msgstr ""
"Un tarif en direct que vous avez remplacé par un montant fixe s'affiche même "
"lorsque le transporteur ne renvoie aucun tarif pour l'adresse. Désactivé le "
"masque dans ce cas."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1044
msgid "Carrier accounts"
msgstr "Comptes transporteurs"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1045
msgid ""
"USPS, UPS, FedEx, DHL, Canada Post and Australia Post credentials and origin "
"details. A carrier quotes once its details are complete."
msgstr ""
"Informations d'identification et d'origine d'USPS, UPS, FedEx, DHL, Postes "
"Canada et Australia Post. Un transporteur propose des devis une fois que ses "
"détails sont complets."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1053
msgid ""
"Royal Mail postage at checkout for shops that post from the UK, priced from "
"Royal Mail’s own price lists"
msgstr ""
"Frais d'envoi Royal Mail à la commande pour les boutiques qui expédient "
"depuis le Royaume-Uni, calculés d'après les propres grilles tarifaires de "
"Royal Mail"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1060
msgid "Offer Royal Mail at checkout"
msgstr "Proposer Royal Mail à la commande"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1061
msgid ""
"Adds the Royal Mail services you pick to the live rates shoppers choose "
"from, priced by each parcel’s size, weight and destination. Needs Live "
"carrier rates as the shipping method."
msgstr ""
"Ajoute les services Royal Mail que vous choisissez aux tarifs en temps réel "
"proposés aux clients, calculés selon la taille, le poids et la destination "
"de chaque colis. Nécessite Tarifs de transporteur en temps réel comme mode "
"de livraison."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1071
msgid ""
"Online prices are what Royal Mail charges through Click & Drop; Post Office "
"prices are for stamps and the counter."
msgstr ""
"Les tarifs en ligne sont ceux que Royal Mail applique via Click & Drop ; les "
"tarifs Post Office sont ceux des timbres et du guichet."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1073
msgid "Online ( Click & Drop )"
msgstr "En ligne ( Click & Drop )"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1074
msgid "Post Office"
msgstr "Post Office"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1092
msgid "Size for products without measurements"
msgstr "Format des produits sans dimensions"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1093
msgid ""
"Royal Mail prices by size. A product with no length, width and height is "
"sent at least this size."
msgstr ""
"Royal Mail établit ses tarifs selon le format. Un produit sans longueur, "
"largeur ni hauteur est expédié au minimum dans ce format."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1095
msgid "Large Letter"
msgstr "Grande lettre"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1096
msgid "Small Parcel"
msgstr "Petit colis"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1097
msgid "Medium Parcel"
msgstr "Colis moyen"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1109
msgid "VAT in Tracked prices"
msgstr "TVA dans les tarifs Tracked"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1110
msgid ""
"Royal Mail’s Tracked prices include 20% VAT. Leave it out when your tax "
"settings add VAT to shipping, so it is not charged twice."
msgstr ""
"Les tarifs Tracked de Royal Mail incluent 20 % de TVA. Excluez-la lorsque "
"vos paramètres de taxes ajoutent la TVA à la livraison, afin qu'elle ne soit "
"pas facturée deux fois."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1112
msgid "Include it, as Royal Mail prints them"
msgstr "L'inclure, comme dans les tarifs imprimés par Royal Mail"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1113
msgid "Leave it out"
msgstr "L'exclure"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1126
msgid "Add the collection charge"
msgstr "Ajouter les frais d'enlèvement"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1127
msgid ""
"Adds Royal Mail’s charge for collecting from you to each parcel ( 50p in the "
"October 2026 prices )."
msgstr ""
"Ajoute à chaque colis les frais que Royal Mail facture pour venir le "
"chercher chez vous ( 50p dans les tarifs d'octobre 2026 )."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1147
msgid "Check for new Royal Mail prices"
msgstr "Rechercher de nouveaux tarifs Royal Mail"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1148
msgid "Your store checks once a day; this checks now."
msgstr ""
"Votre boutique vérifie une fois par jour ; ceci lance la vérification "
"maintenant."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1157
msgid "Fraktjakt account"
msgstr "Compte Fraktjakt"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1158
msgid "Swedish carrier aggregator, used when the shipping method is Fraktjakt"
msgstr ""
"Agrégateur de transporteurs suédois, utilisé lorsque la méthode de livraison "
"est Fraktjakt"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1163
msgid "Customer ID"
msgstr "ID Client"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1164
msgid "From your Fraktjakt account settings."
msgstr "Depuis les paramètres de votre compte Fraktjakt."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1173
msgid "Login key"
msgstr "Clé de connexion"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1174
msgid "The API login key from your Fraktjakt account. Keep it private."
msgstr ""
"La clé de connexion API de votre compte Fraktjakt. Gardez-la confidentielle."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1183
msgid "Currency conversion rate"
msgstr "Taux de conversion de devise"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1184
msgid ""
"Multiplier applied to Fraktjakt’s SEK quotes to reach your store currency. "
"1.000 means no conversion."
msgstr ""
"Multiplicateur appliqué aux tarifs en SEK de Fraktjakt pour obtenir la "
"devise de votre boutique. 1,000 signifie aucune conversion."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1198
msgid ""
"Sends quote requests to Fraktjakt’s test server. Turn off before taking real "
"orders."
msgstr ""
"Envoie les demandes de tarif au serveur de test de Fraktjakt. Désactivez "
"avant de prendre de vraies commandes."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1209
msgid "Ship-from address"
msgstr "Adresse d'expédition"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1210
msgid ""
"The origin Fraktjakt quotes from. Other carriers take their origin details "
"in their own setup above."
msgstr ""
"L'origine à partir de laquelle Fraktjakt calcule ses tarifs. Les autres "
"transporteurs récupèrent leurs informations d'origine dans leur propre "
"configuration ci-dessus."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1215
msgid "Street address"
msgstr "Adresse"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1216
msgid "Where parcels are collected from."
msgstr "Lieu de collecte des colis."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1234
msgid "State or province code"
msgstr "Code d'état ou de province"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1235
msgid ""
"Two-character code, only if your country uses them. Leave empty otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Code à deux caractères, uniquement si votre pays les utilise. Laissez vide "
"sinon."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1256
msgid "Saved as the two-letter country code Fraktjakt expects."
msgstr ""
"Enregistré sous forme du code pays à deux lettres attendu par Fraktjakt."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1270
msgid "Shipping zones"
msgstr "Zones de livraison"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1271
msgid "Group countries and regions so a rate table can charge by destination"
msgstr ""
"Regroupez des pays et régions afin qu'un tableau de tarifs puisse facturer "
"selon la destination"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1277
msgid "Ship-to countries & regions"
msgstr "Pays et régions de livraison"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1278
msgid "Where you are willing to ship"
msgstr "Là où vous acceptez de livrer"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:93 admin/template/settings/tax.php:268
msgid "Select a state"
msgstr "Sélectionnez un état"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:123
msgid "Choose one first"
msgstr "Choisissez-en un d'abord"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:124
msgid "Enter a rate"
msgstr "Saisissez un taux"

#. translators: %s: the place the rate is for, e.g. Canada.
#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:127
#, php-format
msgid "Delete the %s rate?"
msgstr "Supprimer le tarif %s ?"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:128
msgid "Orders already placed keep the tax they were charged."
msgstr "Les commandes déjà passées conservent la taxe qui leur a été facturée."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:129
msgid "Keep it"
msgstr "Sauvagarder"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:130
msgid "Delete rate"
msgstr "Supprimer le taux"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:131
msgid "Not saved"
msgstr "Non enregistré"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:132
msgid "You have tax rates that are not saved."
msgstr "Vous avez des taux de taxe non enregistrés."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:308
msgid "Save (Enter). Esc undoes."
msgstr "Enregistrer (Entrée). Échap annule."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:308
msgid "Save this row"
msgstr "Enregistrer cette ligne"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:353 admin/template/settings/tax.php:391
#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:404
#: admin/template/settings/wizard/location.php:1991
#: inc/classes/core/class-wp-easycart-privacy.php:174
msgid "State"
msgstr "État"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:365
msgid "Edit this rate"
msgstr "Modifier ce tarif"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:366
msgid "Delete this rate"
msgstr "Supprimer ce tarif"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:370
msgid "Save (Enter). Esc cancels."
msgstr "Enregistrer (Entrée). Esc annule."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:370
msgid "Save rate"
msgstr "Enregistrer le taux"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:386
msgid ""
"One row per state or province. The rate applies when the shipping address is "
"in that state; a state with no row is not taxed."
msgstr ""
"Une ligne par état ou province. Le taux s'applique lorsque l'adresse de "
"livraison se trouve dans cet état ; un état sans ligne n'est pas taxé."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:386
msgid ""
"One row per country. The rate applies when the shipping address is in that "
"country and no state rate matched first."
msgstr ""
"Une ligne par pays. Le taux s'applique lorsque l'adresse de livraison se "
"trouve dans ce pays et qu'aucun taux d'état ne s'est déjà appliqué."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:419 admin/template/settings/tax.php:430
msgid "Add a state rate"
msgstr "Ajouter une région"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:419 admin/template/settings/tax.php:430
msgid "Add a country rate"
msgstr "Ajouter un pays"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:428
msgid "No state rates yet"
msgstr "Pas encore de taux d'État"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:428
msgid "No country rates yet"
msgstr "Pas encore de taux par pays"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:429
msgid ""
"Add one for each state or province you collect tax in. A state with no row "
"is not taxed."
msgstr ""
"Ajoutez-en un pour chaque État ou province où vous percevez la taxe. Un État "
"sans ligne n'est pas taxé."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:429
msgid ""
"Add one for each country you collect tax in. State rates are checked first, "
"then these."
msgstr ""
"Ajoutez-en un pour chaque pays dans lequel vous percevez la taxe. Les tarifs "
"d'État sont d'abord vérifiés, puis ceux-ci."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:468 admin/template/settings/tax.php:490
msgid "Apply to business"
msgstr "Appliquer aux professionnels"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:468
msgid "Apply to VAT-registered businesses"
msgstr "Appliquer aux entreprises immatriculées à la TVA"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:483
msgid ""
"Rate per country, used once the shopper enters their country at checkout. "
"Countries not listed are not charged VAT. \"Apply to business\" charges the "
"country rate to VAT-registered businesses too, instead of the business rate."
msgstr ""
"Taux par pays, utilisé une fois que l'acheteur indique son pays au moment du "
"paiement. Les pays non listés ne sont pas soumis à la TVA. « Appliquer aux "
"professionnels » facture aussi le taux du pays aux entreprises immatriculées "
"à la TVA, au lieu du taux professionnel."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:502
msgid "No country rates yet. Add the first one below."
msgstr "Aucun taux de pays pour le moment. Ajoutez le premier ci-dessous."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:534
msgid "Customer role"
msgstr "Rôle du client"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:540
msgid ""
"Tick the provinces you collect in for this role and set their rates in "
"percent. Ticks save straight away; rate changes save with the ✓ button or "
"Enter."
msgstr ""
"Cochez les provinces où vous collectez la taxe pour ce rôle et définissez "
"leurs taux en pourcentage. Les cases se sauvegardent immédiatement ; les "
"modifications de taux s'enregistrent avec le bouton ✓ ou la touche Entrée."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:540
msgid ""
"Quebec: enter the QST ( 9.975% ) in the PST column. Shoppers, emails and "
"orders see it named QST ( TVQ in French ), and it is charged on the price "
"before GST, as Revenu Québec requires."
msgstr ""
"Québec : saisissez la TVQ ( 9,975 % ) dans la colonne PST. Les acheteurs, "
"les e-mails et les commandes l'affichent sous le nom de TVQ (QST en "
"anglais), et elle est facturée sur le prix avant la TPS, comme l'exige "
"Revenu Québec."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:547
msgid "Province"
msgstr "Province"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:548 admin/template/settings/tax.php:558
msgid "Collect"
msgstr "Collecter"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:619
msgid "This check is not available."
msgstr "Cette vérification n'est pas disponible."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:641
msgid "Calculating tax at checkout."
msgstr "Calcul des taxes lors de la commande."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:642
msgid "Not finished"
msgstr "Non terminé"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:642
msgid "Some details are missing, so it is not calculating tax yet."
msgstr ""
"Certaines informations manquent, donc il ne calcule pas encore les taxes."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:643
msgid ""
"Set up, but another tax service is in use ( Tax service in use, above )."
msgstr ""
"Configuré, mais un autre service de taxes est utilisé ( Service de taxes "
"utilisé, ci-dessus )."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:673
msgid ""
"What tax you collect and where: a flat rate, rates by state or country, VAT, "
"Canadian GST/PST/HST, duty, or an automated service."
msgstr ""
"La taxe que vous collectez et où : un taux fixe, des taux par état ou pays, "
"la TVA, la TPS/PST/HST canadienne, des droits de douane, ou un service "
"automatisé."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:684
msgid "Where you collect"
msgstr "Où vous collectez"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:685
msgid "The base rules that apply to every order"
msgstr "Les règles de base qui s'appliquent à chaque commande"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:689
msgid "Flat rate on every order"
msgstr "Taux fixe sur chaque commande"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:690
msgid ""
"One rate on every taxable order, whatever the destination. Use rates by "
"state or country instead when tax depends on where you ship."
msgstr ""
"Un seul taux sur chaque commande taxable, quelle que soit la destination. "
"Utilisez plutôt des taux par état ou pays lorsque la taxe dépend du lieu de "
"livraison."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:698
msgid "Flat tax rate"
msgstr "Taux de taxe fixe"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:699
msgid "Percentage charged on the taxable subtotal of every order."
msgstr "Pourcentage facturé sur le sous-total taxable de chaque commande."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:712
msgid "Charge tax on shipping"
msgstr "Facturer la taxe sur la livraison"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:713
msgid ""
"Adds the shipping charge to the amount your flat, state, country and "
"Canadian rates apply to. Does not apply to TaxCloud."
msgstr ""
"Ajoute les frais de livraison au montant sur lequel s'appliquent vos taux "
"fixe, d'état, de pays et canadiens. Ne s'applique pas à TaxCloud."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:721
msgid "Rates by state"
msgstr "Taux par état"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:722
msgid "A rate for each state or province you collect in"
msgstr "Un taux pour chaque état ou province où vous collectez"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:728
msgid "Rates by country"
msgstr "Taux par pays"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:729
msgid "A rate for each country you collect in"
msgstr "Un taux pour chaque pays où vous collectez"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:736
msgid "Value added tax, one rate or a rate per country"
msgstr "Taxe sur la valeur ajoutée, un taux unique ou un taux par pays"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:740
msgid "Charge VAT"
msgstr "Facturer la TVA"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:741
msgid ""
"Adds VAT to orders. Choose below whether one rate applies everywhere or each "
"country has its own."
msgstr ""
"Ajoute la TVA aux commandes. Choisissez ci-dessous si un seul taux "
"s'applique partout ou si chaque pays a le sien."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:749
msgid "Rate varies by country"
msgstr "Le taux varie selon le pays"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:750
msgid ""
"Uses the country rates in the table below once the shopper enters their "
"address. Off charges the default rate everywhere."
msgstr ""
"Utilise les taux par pays du tableau ci-dessous une fois que l'acheteur "
"saisit son adresse. Désactivé facture le taux par défaut partout."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:759
msgid "Default VAT rate"
msgstr "Taux de TVA par défaut"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:760
msgid ""
"Charged before the shopper’s country is known, and everywhere when the rate "
"does not vary by country."
msgstr ""
"Facturé avant que le pays de l'acheteur ne soit connu, et partout lorsque le "
"taux ne varie pas selon le pays."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:773
msgid "Prices include VAT"
msgstr "Les prix incluent la TVA"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:774
msgid ""
"Product prices are shown VAT-inclusive and the VAT portion is broken out at "
"checkout. Off adds VAT on top at checkout."
msgstr ""
"Les prix des produits s'affichent TVA incluse et la part de TVA est "
"détaillée au moment du paiement. Désactivé ajoute la TVA en plus au moment "
"du paiement."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:783
msgid "Exempt shipping from VAT"
msgstr "Exonérer la livraison de TVA"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:784
msgid ""
"Leaves the shipping charge out of the VAT total. Off charges VAT on shipping "
"too."
msgstr ""
"Exclut les frais de livraison du total de TVA. Désactivé facture aussi la "
"TVA sur la livraison."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:791
msgid "Rate for VAT-registered businesses"
msgstr "Taux pour les entreprises immatriculées à la TVA"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:792
msgid ""
"Charged instead of the country rate when a shopper enters a VAT registration "
"number at checkout and their country is not marked \"Apply to business\" "
"below. Needs the VAT number field turned on under Checkout."
msgstr ""
"Facturé à la place du taux du pays lorsqu'un acheteur saisit un numéro de "
"TVA intracommunautaire au moment du paiement et que son pays n'est pas "
"marqué « Appliquer aux professionnels » ci-dessous. Nécessite que le champ "
"numéro de TVA soit activé dans Paiement."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:805
msgid "Verify VAT numbers with Vatlayer"
msgstr "Vérifier les numéros de TVA avec Vatlayer"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:806
msgid ""
"Checks the VAT registration number a shopper enters at checkout against the "
"Vatlayer service before the business rate applies."
msgstr ""
"Vérifie le numéro de TVA saisi par un acheteur au moment du paiement auprès "
"du service Vatlayer avant que le taux professionnel ne s'applique."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:814
msgid "Vatlayer API key"
msgstr "Clé API Vatlayer"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:815
msgid ""
"From your Vatlayer account. Required for verification and the business rate."
msgstr ""
"Depuis votre compte Vatlayer. Requise pour la vérification et le taux "
"professionnel."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:823
msgid "Rounding increment"
msgstr "Incrément d'arrondi"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:824
msgid ""
"VAT totals round to this amount. Most countries use 0.01; some require 0.05."
msgstr ""
"Les totaux de TVA s'arrondissent à ce montant. La plupart des pays utilisent "
"0,01 ; certains exigent 0,05."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:839
msgid "Test Vatlayer"
msgstr "Tester Vatlayer"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:840
msgid ""
"Checks a VAT number with your saved Vatlayer API key and shows the answer. "
"Leave the box empty to try a sample number."
msgstr ""
"Vérifie un numéro de TVA avec votre clé API Vatlayer enregistrée et affiche "
"la réponse. Laissez le champ vide pour essayer un numéro d'exemple."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:841
msgid "Run test"
msgstr "Lancer le test"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:843
msgid "VAT number to check"
msgstr "Numéro de TVA à vérifier"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:844
msgid "VAT number ( optional )"
msgstr "Numéro de TVA ( facultatif )"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:852
msgid "Canada GST/PST/HST"
msgstr "TPS/PST/HST du Canada"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:853
msgid "Provincial rates for orders shipped to Canada"
msgstr "Taux provinciaux pour les commandes livrées au Canada"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:857
msgid "Canadian provincial tax"
msgstr "Taxe provinciale canadienne"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:858
msgid ""
"Charges GST, PST or HST by province on orders shipped to Canada, with "
"separate rates per customer role. Turning it on ticks every province."
msgstr ""
"Facture la TPS, la PST ou la HST par province sur les commandes livrées au "
"Canada, avec des taux distincts par rôle client. L'activation coche toutes "
"les provinces."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:869
msgid "A percentage on orders shipped abroad"
msgstr "Un pourcentage sur les commandes livrées à l'étranger"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:873
msgid "Charge duty on international orders"
msgstr "Facturer les droits de douane sur les commandes internationales"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:874
msgid ""
"Adds a duty percentage to orders shipped to any country other than the "
"exempt country below."
msgstr ""
"Ajoute un pourcentage de droits de douane aux commandes livrées vers tout "
"pays autre que le pays exonéré ci-dessous."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:882
msgid "Duty-exempt country"
msgstr "Pays exonéré de droits de douane"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:883
msgid "Usually your own country. Orders shipped here pay no duty."
msgstr ""
"Généralement votre propre pays. Les commandes livrées ici ne paient aucun "
"droit de douane."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:886
msgid "None – every country pays duty"
msgstr "Aucun – tous les pays paient des droits de douane"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:895
msgid "Duty rate"
msgstr "Taux de droits de douane"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:896
msgid "Percentage charged on the taxable subtotal of orders that owe duty."
msgstr ""
"Pourcentage facturé sur le sous-total taxable des commandes soumises à des "
"droits de douane."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:911
msgid "Automated tax services"
msgstr "Services de taxe automatisés"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:912
msgid ""
"Live rates from TaxCloud, TaxJar or Avalara AvaTax instead of your own tables"
