#: inc/classes/core/class-wp-easycart-paypal-webhooks.php:981
msgid ""
"PayPal tells your store about refunds, reversals and payments that finish "
"later. Each notification carries your store’s key, so a forged one is turned "
"away."
msgstr ""
"PayPal informe votre boutique des remboursements, des annulations et des "
"paiements qui se terminent plus tard. Chaque notification porte la clé de "
"votre boutique, ce qui permet de rejeter une notification falsifiée."

#: inc/classes/core/class-wp-easycart-paypal-webhooks.php:983
msgid ""
"PayPal sends notifications from your own PayPal app and signs each one; your "
"store checks the signature and turns away anything else."
msgstr ""
"PayPal envoie les notifications depuis votre propre application PayPal et "
"signe chacune d'elles ; votre boutique vérifie la signature et rejette tout "
"le reste."

